  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "A past memory",
     "texto": [
      "**-던** presents a habitual or ongoing action remembered from the present; on its own it does not guarantee that the situation has ended: 살다 → **살던 집** (the house where I used to live), 다니다 → **다니던 회사** (the company where I used to work), 좋아하다 → **좋아하던 노래** (the song I used to like).",
      "예전에 **살던** 집 = the house where (I) used to live before."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "With or without a consonant",
     "texto": [
      "Drop 다 and add **-던**, the same for verbs and adjectives.",
      "예쁘다 → **예쁘던 옷** (the clothes that used to be pretty)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
